 to go to the Panther Room in the Hotel Sherman, where Gene Krupa had his band there. I always found him to be very congenial. Whatever you wanted to do, great. He took time in between sets to come over and chat with me. I was just a kid. He'd buy me a drink. Of course it was soda then. No liquor. I was never a drinker ...", "type": "string"}, "datatype": "string"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q11011$3338A7FF-7F41-44D6-B539-1FCFAB3F8A58", "rank": "normal"}], "P20": [{"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P20", "hash": "1bf808761128009a37df4a2b8ce41cca53b576f0", "datavalue": {"value": "https://semlab.s3.amazonaws.com/texts/8c3ff6578b7b25fa86a7c9d7a9053d1b/215.txt", "type": "string"}, "datatype": "url"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q11011$34837743-FC46-4502-AE32-EF60741E908E", "rank": "normal"}], "P21": [{"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P21", "hash": "55b04cb7baa96ca6be10e015e9b73f02f9bd0c68", "datavalue": {"value": {"entity-type": "item", "numeric-id": 1196, "id": "Q1196"}, "type": "wikibase-entityid"}, "datatype": "wikibase-item"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q11011$222144EB-50C9-4412-B542-A364750B2478", "rank": "normal"}, {"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P21", "hash": "d867621ca18fcbcf34262c91de8ee60e5aeed832", "datavalue": {"value": {"entity-type": "item", "numeric-id": 432, "id": "Q432"}, "type": "wikibase-entityid"}, "datatype": "wikibase-item"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q11011$9F8D5EC2-2DE5-44AD-94B8-B42BE664CAEE", "rank": "normal"}, {"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P21", "hash": "29a9a2fc2e7223e2eeb0cc9dd02fe0510d5c7635", "datavalue": {"value": {"entity-type": "item", "numeric-id": 1157, "id": "Q1157"}, "type": "wikibase-entityid"}, "datatype": "wikibase-item"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q11011$9DFF0A96-652B-4BAD-A83F-5E98D397F5B2", "rank": "normal"}, {"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P21", "hash": "9275854cdcc21cf5099a2e2d934d077216ea6898", "datavalue": {"value": {"entity-type": "item", 